        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-41928\"><b>Laurey 41928, Modern Metro Cabinet Knob in Satin Nickel</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its sleek lines, the Satin Nickel Metro Cabinet Knob is the ultimate in modern cabinet hardware. It has a nice Satin Nickel for a contemporary look. The Modern Metro Cabinet Knob in Satin Nickel comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Satin Nickel Metro Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish:Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1.92\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 6/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Metro\">Laurey Metro Collection</a>.\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-41928\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-41928-SM.jpg?v=1704354526\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-41928\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/polished-chrome-metro-cabinet-knob-laurey-41926\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-41926-SM.jpg?v=1704354526\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-41926\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-nickel-metro-cabinet-pull-collection-laurey-metro-sn\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-41028-SM.jpg?v=1704354526\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-41028.jpg\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/polished-chrome-metro-cabinet-pull-collection-laurey-metro-pc\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-41026-SM.jpg?v=1704354526\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" alt=\"LAU-41026\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr class=\"text\" align=\"center\">\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-41928\"><b>Satin Nickel Metro Cabinet Knob</b>